{"config": "B-hybrid-rerank-gptoss20b", "qid": "A04", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "An NBFC must report its digital lending apps on the Centralised Information Management System (CIMS) portal of the Reserve Bank of India.", "citations": ["D16_B_0026"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00020954999999999997, "gen_latency_s": 1.019898500002455, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2678, "output_tokens": 125, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.00020955, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D16_B_0026", "D16_B_0027", "D16_B_0020", "D16_B_0015", "D16_B_0025"], "retrieval_latency_s": 3.1198679999943124, "total_latency_s": 4.139867099991534, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "B-hybrid-rerank-gptoss20b", "qid": "A05", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "When a lending service provider (LSP) works with multiple lenders, it must provide the borrower with a digital view of all loan offers that match the borrower’s request. This view must include the name(s) of the lenders extending the offer, the amount and tenor of each loan, the APR, the monthly repayment obligation, any applicable penalty charges, and a link to the Knowledge Feed Summary (KFS) for each lender. It must also disclose the names of any lenders whose offers are not matched to the borrower’s request.", "citations": ["D16_B_0013"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00025147500000000003, "gen_latency_s": 0.8538388999877498, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2801, "output_tokens": 234, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000251475, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D16_B_0013", "D16_B_0049", "D16_B_0017", "D16_B_0061", "D16_B_0033"], "retrieval_latency_s": 3.762678799990681, "total_latency_s": 4.616630299991812, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "B-hybrid-rerank-gptoss20b", "qid": "A06", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "Yes. An NBFC may retain a reasonable one‑time processing fee if a borrower exits a digital loan during the cooling‑off period, provided the fee is disclosed upfront in the Key Fact Statement.", "citations": ["D16_B_0019"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.000211875, "gen_latency_s": 1.730238600008306, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2637, "output_tokens": 143, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000211875, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D16_B_0019", "D16_B_0018", "D16_B_0015", "D16_B_0017", "D16_B_0020"], "retrieval_latency_s": 3.7657364000042435, "total_latency_s": 5.496086099999957, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "B-hybrid-rerank-gptoss20b", "qid": "A07", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "No. An NBFC’s digital lending app (or its digital lending agent) must not access a borrower’s phone resources such as files, media, contact list, call logs or other telephony functions. Only a one‑time access to camera, microphone, location or similar facilities for onboarding/KYC may be taken with explicit consent.", "citations": ["D16_B_0021"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.000210825, "gen_latency_s": 1.0427977999934228, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2623, "output_tokens": 175, "cache_read_input_tokens": 1024, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000210825, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D16_B_0021", "D16_B_0016", "D16_B_0026", "D16_B_0015", "D16_B_0020"], "retrieval_latency_s": 3.597189399995841, "total_latency_s": 4.640092900008312, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "B-hybrid-rerank-gptoss20b", "qid": "A08", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "If the borrower has not received any reply to a complaint lodged with the NBFC within 30 days, the borrower may file a complaint through the RBI’s Complaint Management System (CMS) portal under the Reserve Bank–Integrated Ombudsman Scheme or send a physical complaint to the Centralised Receipt and Processing Centre, 4th Floor, Reserve Bank of India, Sector‑17, Central Vista, Chandigarh – 160017, as prescribed by the RBI.", "citations": ["D16_B_0020"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.000236175, "gen_latency_s": 1.1227524999994785, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2761, "output_tokens": 193, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000236175, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D16_B_0020", "D16_B_0015", "D16_B_0017", "D16_B_0026", "D16_B_0016"], "retrieval_latency_s": 3.303475900000194, "total_latency_s": 4.426341400001547, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
