{"config": "B-hybrid-rerank-gptoss20b", "qid": "A34", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": true, "answer": "Under the KYC Master Direction, high‑risk customers must have their KYC updated at least once every two years; medium‑risk customers once every eight years; and low‑risk customers once every ten years. For low‑risk individual customers, the direction also allows a one‑year update window if the due date falls before June 30 2026, whichever is later. Note: \"Master Direction - Know Your Customer (KYC) Direction, 2016\" (issued 2016-02-25) has been withdrawn or superseded and replaced by entity-wise KYC Directions, 2025. The rule currently in force may differ.", "citations": ["D12_B_0044"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": ["D12_B_0044"], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.000292575, "gen_latency_s": 1.1825707999960287, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 3289, "output_tokens": 249, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000292575, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D12_B_0044", "D12_B_0048", "D12_B_0047", "D12_B_0067", "D12_B_0037"], "retrieval_latency_s": 4.3438278999965405, "total_latency_s": 5.5265212999947835, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
